sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant API as Purchase API
  participant P as Provider verifier
  participant L as Ledger
  participant N as Notification/outbox
  C->>API: Purchase receipt + provider transaction ID
  API->>P: Verify receipt
  P-->>API: Verified or rejected
  API->>API: Reserve permanent idempotency key
  API->>L: Commit entitlement and balanced ledger transaction
  API->>N: Emit purchase fact
  API-->>C: Entitlement status and receipt
  Note over API,L: Refunds and chargebacks compensate; ledger history is not edited
